Package: dataexplorer
Title: Explore Published Border Quarantine Simulation Scenarios
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Yixiang", "Xu",
    email = "yxuu0346@student.monash.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides published border quarantine simulation data and
    tools for selecting scenarios by viral transmissibility and vaccine
    efficacy. Includes a Shiny application for comparing relative
    infection pressure across scenarios reported by Zachreson et al.
    (2022) <doi:10.1126/sciadv.abm3624>.
